  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Absolute Green Bond for Wind Power Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction is a THB[3] billion investment (approximately $95 million equivalent) cornerstone investment into Energy Absolute&amp;apos;s (&amp;quot;EA&amp;quot;) maiden THB10 billion certified green bond issuance. The bond&amp;apos;s proceeds will be used for the refinancing of EA&amp;apos;s 260 MW Hanuman Wind Farm in Chaiyaphum Province in northeastern Thailand, which achieved COD in April 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
